\title{Satellite Radar Altimetry for Long-Term Water-Level
Monitoring of Small Reservoirs}
\author{S.~Beltran and M.~Opondo}
\date{May 2026}

\begin{document}
\maketitle

\begin{abstract}
We assess whether repeated satellite radar altimetry can track
water levels in reservoirs smaller than one square kilometre,
a size class usually excluded from operational monitoring.
Against gauge records from 19 reservoirs, a waveform
retracking pipeline achieves sub-decimetre agreement on 14 of
them across a six-year record.
\end{abstract}

